1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
2036. Every day, we press the same button.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,500
I agree.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,500
But the same tool does not mean
the same possibilities.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,000
The languages we can speak.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,500
The work we can take with us.

6
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,500
The next system we can choose.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,000
These terms reach beyond
one person's screen.

8
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:45,500
They shape the choices of schools,
hospitals, and entire societies.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,500
We began to ask:

10
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:55,500
Could we change these terms, too?

11
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Learning in our own languages.

12
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:07,500
Sharing what we learn.

13
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Taking our work with us.

14
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:19,500
Choosing another path.

15
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:25,500
Respecting each other's data.

16
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:31,500
Building together.

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,000
The terms of tomorrow begin
with the connections we build today.
